Troubleshooting
Issue: "Connection refused" errors

Solution: Ensure the mock API is running: python3 mock-api/api_server.py &
Issue: "Module not found" errors

Solution: Install required packages: pip3 install flask requests
Issue: Port 5000 already in use

Solution: Find and kill the process: sudo lsof -ti:5000 | xargs kill -9
Issue: Permission denied on log files

Solution: Check directory permissions: chmod 755 logs/
